BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 73.701 205.795 Td (turn the folded edge to the inside and topstitch or slipstitch it down.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 183.118 Td (10. Sew the bodice side seams.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 160.441 Td (11. Sew each skirt gore seam \(center panel to side panel, matching the tip notch\), pressing toward the center.) Tj ET
